        </div>
        <div class="msv__card">
          <span class="msv__card-icon">📚</span>
          <h3 class="msv__card-title">Private Courses & Professional Training</h3>
          <p>Design schools, culinary academies, business programmes, art schools, and other accredited private institutions.</p>
        </div>
